    "synopsis": {
        "native": "Knock, un ex-filou repenti devenu m\u00e9decin dipl\u00f4m\u00e9, arrive dans le petit village de Saint-Maurice pour appliquer une \u00ab m\u00e9thode \u00bb destin\u00e9e \u00e0 faire sa fortune : Il va convaincre la population que tout bien portant est un malade qui s\u2019ignore. Et pour cela, trouver \u00e0 chacun la maladie r\u00e9elle ou imaginaire dont il souffre. Pass\u00e9 ma\u00eetre dans l\u2019art de la s\u00e9duction et de la manipulation, Knock est sur le point de parvenir \u00e0 ses fins. Mais il est rattrap\u00e9 par deux choses qu\u2019il n\u2019avait pas pr\u00e9vues : les sentiments du c\u0153ur et un sombre individu issu de son pass\u00e9 venu le faire chanter.",
        "english": "Knock, a retired crook-turned-qualified doctor, arrives in the small village of St-Maurice to implement a \"method\" he believes will make him rich: he will persuade the villagers that healthy people are simply people who don't realize they are ill. To do this, he needs to find an illness (be that real or imaginary) that afflicts each person. An expert in the art of seduction and manipulation, Knock comes close to achieving his goal. But his plans are rattled by two things he had not foreseen: his own romantic feelings and the appearance of a dubious character from his past who has come to blackmail him."
    },
